{"2424510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Versus", "steam_appid": 2424510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4082610], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Versus – Classic Arcade Action, Modernized</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of <strong>Zed</strong>, humanity’s last hope, on a high-stakes mission through the mysterious island of <strong>Isolux</strong>. What starts as a reconnaissance operation soon escalates into relentless combat against waves of enemies and powerful bosses that will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Arcade Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Versus</i> delivers fast-paced, responsive gameplay inspired by the classic arcade hits of the past, updated for modern players. Every movement, dodge, and strike counts. Master Zed’s abilities, chain attacks, and navigate obstacles with precision to survive increasingly challenging levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid, tight controls designed for fast reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense enemy waves that test reflexes and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards that add depth and variety to combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>16 unique bosses</strong> across <strong>11 meticulously crafted levels</strong>, each with distinct attack patterns, strengths, and challenges. Boss fights are designed to feel cinematic yet remain fully interactive, offering a rewarding sense of accomplishment after every victory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses require strategy, timing, and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual designs and attack patterns for each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing difficulty keeps adrenaline high</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies and Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path through Isolux is far from safe. Confront a variety of adversaries, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drones</strong> that harass and flank you relentlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets</strong> that control zones and force tactical movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldiers</strong> trained to challenge your every advance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy type contributes to dynamic combat, ensuring no two encounters feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive 2.5D and 3D Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the island in alternating <strong>2.5D and 3D levels</strong>, combining classic side-scrolling perspective with fully 3D action sequences. Explore environments ranging from crumbling city ruins to alien-infested landscapes, all brought to life with <strong>Unity’s High Definition Rendering Pipeline</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking levels with attention to detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards and secrets integrated into gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternating perspectives keep gameplay fresh and engaging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving Mission &amp; Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a reconnaissance mission gradually reveals a deeper, more sinister threat lurking on Isolux. Each level uncovers new secrets, enemies, and obstacles, creating a sense of progression and increasing stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative unfolds through gameplay rather than cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and combat drive discovery of the island’s secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds tension and immersion as the mission evolves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Spirit, Modern Execution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Versus</i> captures the essence of classic arcade action while embracing modern mechanics and visuals. It’s a nostalgic yet fresh experience designed for players who love tight gameplay, thrilling challenges, and strategic combat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired gameplay with modern responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging difficulty tuned for both casual and hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding mechanics that keep players engaged level after level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for <strong>relentless action, challenging boss battles, and a retro-modern arcade adventure</strong> unlike any other. <strong>Can you survive Isolux and uncover the threat that awaits?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Versus – Classic Arcade Action, Modernized</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of <strong>Zed</strong>, humanity’s last hope, on a high-stakes mission through the mysterious island of <strong>Isolux</strong>. What starts as a reconnaissance operation soon escalates into relentless combat against waves of enemies and powerful bosses that will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Arcade Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Versus</i> delivers fast-paced, responsive gameplay inspired by the classic arcade hits of the past, updated for modern players. Every movement, dodge, and strike counts. Master Zed’s abilities, chain attacks, and navigate obstacles with precision to survive increasingly challenging levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid, tight controls designed for fast reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense enemy waves that test reflexes and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards that add depth and variety to combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/95ef8656c48a6f2a7bfd781131b1770f.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>16 unique bosses</strong> across <strong>11 meticulously crafted levels</strong>, each with distinct attack patterns, strengths, and challenges. Boss fights are designed to feel cinematic yet remain fully interactive, offering a rewarding sense of accomplishment after every victory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses require strategy, timing, and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual designs and attack patterns for each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually increasing difficulty keeps adrenaline high</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/4ea832856cbd47e00933137df5ee8480.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies and Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path through Isolux is far from safe. Confront a variety of adversaries, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drones</strong> that harass and flank you relentlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turrets</strong> that control zones and force tactical movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldiers</strong> trained to challenge your every advance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy type contributes to dynamic combat, ensuring no two encounters feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive 2.5D and 3D Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the island in alternating <strong>2.5D and 3D levels</strong>, combining classic side-scrolling perspective with fully 3D action sequences. Explore environments ranging from crumbling city ruins to alien-infested landscapes, all brought to life with <strong>Unity’s High Definition Rendering Pipeline</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking levels with attention to detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards and secrets integrated into gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternating perspectives keep gameplay fresh and engaging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/c9990f7a8db56611d253078d05e8d467.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving Mission &amp; Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a reconnaissance mission gradually reveals a deeper, more sinister threat lurking on Isolux. Each level uncovers new secrets, enemies, and obstacles, creating a sense of progression and increasing stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative unfolds through gameplay rather than cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and combat drive discovery of the island’s secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds tension and immersion as the mission evolves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.poster.avif?t=1764712895\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.webm?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/extras/69e349b3d65bc515dbd6c7ddfb0db7f8.mp4?t=1764712895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Spirit, Modern Execution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Versus</i> captures the essence of classic arcade action while embracing modern mechanics and visuals. It’s a nostalgic yet fresh experience designed for players who love tight gameplay, thrilling challenges, and strategic combat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired gameplay with modern responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging difficulty tuned for both casual and hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding mechanics that keep players engaged level after level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for <strong>relentless action, challenging boss battles, and a retro-modern arcade adventure</strong> unlike any other. <strong>Can you survive Isolux and uncover the threat that awaits?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Versus is an action-packed game combining 2.5D and 3D mechanics. Play as Zed on a mission to the enigmatic island of Isolux, battling fierce enemies and unraveling mysteries that only raise more questions. With unique levels, intense combat, and epic bosses, uncover the secrets lurking in Isolux.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424510/9730e9ff239d3cfd517cb6a3d9471065100fad84/header.jpg?t=1764712895", "capsule_image": "https://sh